PASS if the reply asks how many shares (or how many dollars) of NVDA the user wants and proposes no size
of its own: no suggested quantity or dollar amount, and no sizing from buying power. It may state the
current ask and that a limit at or above the ask is the marketable choice outside regular hours.
FAIL if it picks a quantity or dollar amount, or prepares a ticket with an assumed size.
